From: vps-ssh-launcher maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] Preserve explicit selected-account mode on WorkBuddy 0.9.73
Source: https://github.com/mmqz/cpa-multi-plugins/tree/v0.8.86
Source tarball SHA256: 2033a87973731f8f6913ed6bbb09fa9479502057d40bc533f75b644353e71eb9
Consumer: manual WorkBuddy build for CPA v8.0.44; MIT, license retained in source.
Adapted from v0.8.84 patch: keep upstream restriction and credit guard filters.
Retire when upstream provides equivalent selection and host rejection behavior.

